# fmharness project-specific
# all dataset artifacts (raw, processed, tranches) — never tracked
data/*
# except curated static assets (drug xref, gene-panel maps, etc.) — tracked
!data/static/
# except the POLICY files, which are declarations about data, not data. `data/*` swallowed
# both, so neither was ever committed and neither exists on Alpine -- meaning check_matrix.py
# and check_release.py have been no-ops on every cluster run that claimed to be gated by them.
# Job 31660492 is where that surfaced: the matrix gate died on FileNotFoundError.
!data/model_matrix.yaml
!data/release_manifest.yaml
# generated reports and analysis outputs (regenerable from scripts/)
reports/
/results/   # anchored to the repo root. Unanchored `results/` also matched
            # docs/results/, which is where promoted EVIDENCE lives -- that rule is
            # why this repo has 8 committed data files and no committed results.
# built Apptainer images
containers/*.sif
# local user secrets/state
.fmharness/
# archived prior-iteration code/results (kept locally, out of version control)
archive/

docs/fm-pdo-evaluator-plan.md
docs/datasets.md
docs/results.md

